
Package: finalproject
Title: Geographic and Temporal Patterns in Homicide and Firearm Mortality
Version: 0.0.3
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Jialin",
           family = "Du",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "jialindu@hsph.harvard.edu")
Description: This project investigates geographic and temporal
    patterns in homicide and firearm mortality in the United
    States using publicly available CDC datasets. It examines
    variation in mortality rates across states and over time
    through descriptive statistics and data visualization.
    It documents data provenance, explores differences between
    mortality measures, and discusses uncertainty and
    limitations in interpreting observed patterns.
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
